Give `ActiveSample` a `.store` reference to the running sample's `Store`.

Lets an in-process caller (the workbench's `{t:"import_running"}`
snapshot) read a running sample's `Store` — where petri's `AuditTape`
lives — from `active_samples()` without waiting for the sample to flush
to `.eval`. `ActiveSample` already carries `transcript` for the same
reason.

Apply on `inspect_ai` `model-event-output-streaming` (upstream candidate).
Rationale: `collaborative-auditor` `src/workbench/m1/M1-RUN-AUDITS.md` §Desk.

